s is one of them.<br /> <br /> So far, this is what I got worked out.<br /> <br /> -=-<br /> <br /> Primary Arcanum: Fate<br /> <br /> 1st - The Mage can bind a number of Seba equal to his Fate dots without suffering from the effects of a curse.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Seems <i>really</i> strong. What first level spell is enabling this? Why should they get the sixth-Guild's benefit as their first Attainment (even with Fate-based Scaling)?<br /> <br /> EDIT: What about something for tracking Seba, or where they will be (a more specialized Knowing spell)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 03-29-2017, 05:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T15:05:58-07:00","id":1070324,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1070254-2e-legacies-conversions-and-homebrew?p=1070304#post1070304\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Seems <i>really</i> strong. What first level spell is enabling this? Why should they get the sixth-Guild's benefit as their first Attainment (even with Fate-based Scaling)?<br /> <br /> EDIT: What about something for tracking Seba, or where they will be (a more specialized Knowing spell)?</div> </div> </div> </div>That could work.<br /> <br /> And would you put the Curse-free benefit at the second or the fourth Attainment?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T15:55:40-07:00","id":1070358,"title":"","content":"Anything related to being Curse-Free should probably be the second attainment, as that's when you can get an Attainment that mimics the Practice of Shielding.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12644-herbertisbestbert","name":"HerbertIsBestBert","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12644_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"312"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T16:00:15-07:00","id":1070361,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HerbertIsBestBert</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1070254-2e-legacies-conversions-and-homebrew?p=1070358#post1070358\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anything related to being Curse-Free should probably be the second attainment, as that's when you can get an Attainment that mimics the Practice of Shielding.</div> </div> </div> </div>At earliest, yeah. I could also see it as some kind of &quot;negative&quot; effect, like Fraying or Unmaking, in that it is eliminating the Curse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T21:59:52-07:00","id":1070484,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HerbertIsBestBert</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1070254-2e-legacies-conversions-and-homebrew?p=1070358#post1070358\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anything related to being Curse-Free should probably be the second attainment, as that's when you can get an Attainment that mimics the Practice of Shielding.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1070254-2e-legacies-conversions-and-homebrew?p=1070361#post1070361\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> At earliest, yeah. I could also see it as some kind of &amp;quot;negative&amp;quot; effect, like Fraying or Unmaking, in that it is eliminating the Curse.</div> </div> </div> </div>Perhaps an Unmaking Attainment could grant the Star Chasers (my current test name for the Legacy) the ability to tear away Seba from others, with the possible exception of the Keshina? And in that case, it may require a Clash of Wills if it is allowed?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"u